<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimates of major South African company results expected next week include the following (all figures cents per share):</p>
<p>DAY--COMPANY--PERIOD--CONSENSUS----RANGE---------PVS--</p>
<p>TUE  EDGARS   H2 EPS  638.0	  626.0-642.0   642.0</p>
<p>TUE  EDGARS   H2 DIV  246.5	  245.0-247.0   247.0</p>
<p>WED  FNB	H1 EPS  112.0	  109.0-115.9   103.5</p>
<p>WED  FNB	H1 DIV  22.3	   21.8-23.0     20.0</p>
<p>WED  PPC	H1 EPS  232.52	 221.6-240.0   226.6</p>
<p>WED  PPC	H1 DIV  84.8	   82.0-87.0     85.0</p>
<p>THU  RAINBOW  YR EPS  27.8 loss    20-43 loss   43.4 loss</p>
<p>THU  RAINBOW  YR DIV  nil	    nil	     nil</p>
<p>THU  Plate Glass YR EPS  700.6     689.1-707.5   745.0</p>
<p>THU  Plate Glass YR DIV  333.0     333.0	   333.0</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
